<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Ramesh | Portfolio</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #F9FAFB;
            color: #1F2933;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        
        nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 60px;
            height: 80px;
            background-color: #6C63FF;
        }

        nav .left {
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: white;
        }

        nav ul {
            display: flex;
            list-style: none;
        }

        nav ul li {
            margin: 0 18px;
        }

        nav ul li a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 1rem;
        }

        nav ul li a:hover {
            color: #D1D5FF;
        }

       
        .firstsection {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 100px 60px;
        }

        .leftsection {
            width: 50%;
        }

        .leftsection h2 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: #4B5563;
        }

        .leftsection h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin: 10px 0;
        }

        .role {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin: 15px 0;
            color: #374151;
            max-width: 520px;
        }

        .interest {
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
        }

        #element {
            color: #6C63FF;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .buttons {
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .btn {
            padding: 12px 20px;
            margin-right: 15px;
            background-color: #6C63FF;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 16px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background-color: #554ee2;
        }

        
        .rightsection {
            width: 45%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .profile-img {
            width: 280px;
            height: 280px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 6px solid #6C63FF;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        .profile-img img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .section {
            max-width: 80vw;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 80px 0;
        }

        .section h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .textgray {
            color: gray;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 25px;
            margin-top: 40px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-6px);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: #6C63FF;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .card p {
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            color: #444;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #1F2933;
            color: white;
            padding: 40px 0;
            margin-top: 80px;
        }

        .footer-rights {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #9CA3AF;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            nav {
                padding: 0 30px;
            }

            .firstsection {
                flex-direction: column;
                text-align: center;
            }

            .leftsection,
            .rightsection {
                width: 100%;
            }

            .buttons .btn {
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    
    <header>
        <nav>
            <div class="left">Ramesh Portfolio</div>
            <ul>
                <li><a href="#">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
                <li><a href="#projects">Projects</a></li>
                <li><a href="#contact">Contact</a></li>
            </ul>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <main>

        
        <section class="firstsection">
            <div class="leftsection">
                <h2>Hello, I’m</h2>
                <h1>Ramesh </h1>

                <p class="role">
                    An aspiring web developer with a strong foundation in HTML, CSS,
                    and programming fundamentals, focused on building responsive
                    and user-friendly web interfaces.
                </p>

                <p class="interest">
                    Focused on strengthening my expertise in <span id="element"></span>
                </p>

                <div class="buttons">
                    <button class="btn">Download Resume</button></a>
                    <button class="btn">View Projects</button></a>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="rightsection">
                <div class="profile-img">
                    <img src="_SKT0726.JPG.jpeg" alt="Ramesh Admane">
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="section" id="skills">
            <span class="textgray">What I have learned so far</span>
            <h1>Skills</h1>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>C Programming</h3>
                    <p>Strong understanding of core programming concepts and problem-solving.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Python</h3>
                    <p>Familiar with Python basics, data structures, and scripting.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h3>HTML5</h3>
                    <p>Experience in creating semantic and accessible web pages.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h3>CSS3</h3>
                    <p>Skilled in Flexbox, Grid, and responsive UI design.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="section" id="projects">
            <span class="textgray">Academic & Personal Work</span>
            <h1>Projects</h1>

            <div class="grid">
                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Clone Website</h3>
                    <p>
                        Designed a clone website of amazon,flipkart using HTML and CSS
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="card">
                    <h3>Basic Calculator</h3>
                    <p>
                        Created a simple calculator using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript
                        for basic arithmetic operations.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        
        <section class="section" id="contact">
            <span class="textgray">Get in Touch</span>
            <h1>Contact</h1>

            <p>Email: admaneramesh31@email.com</p>
            
        </section>

    </main>

    
    <footer>
        <div class="footer-rights">
            © 2026 Ramesh Portfolio | All Rights Reserved
        </div>
    </footer>

    
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/typed.js@2.1.0/dist/typed.umd.js"></script>
    <script>
        new Typed('#element', {
            strings: [
                'Front-End Development',
                'Responsive Web Design',
                'Modern UI Design'
            ],
            typeSpeed: 60,
            loop: true
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>
